WEBVTT

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.170
Ah, shoot.

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:16.920
Agreed to house-sit for 'em, helped myself to the forge,
and promptly broke a hammer...

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:18.790
Welly's gonna throw a fit.

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:23.710
Or else, it's... a bad omen.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:30.000
Hey, Tsubaki Collbrande.

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:34.540
Can you lend us a hand in the Dungeon?

00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:54.630
Is it Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?  IV

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:13.960
Morgue

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:13.960
Victim

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.960
I was right... We have to move.

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:14.960
We've gotta run...

00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:17.830
As far away as we possibly can...

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:21.250
There'll be more monsters past this tunnel.

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:24.170
But if we don't get out of here now–

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:39.080
No, no, no!

00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:58.540
FIRE BOLT!

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.750
Pure luck... That's all it was.

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:24.880
That monster will be back...

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:28.330
Miss Ryu?!

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:32.330
Mr. Cranel...?

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:40.210
I see. We're in the Deep Floors...

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:43.420
Miss Ryu...

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:45.670
Please, you need to heal.

00:03:46.210 --> 00:03:50.580
I ran out of items... Use your magic on yourself.

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.250
The song of a now faraway forest...

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:02.960
The comforting melody of life...

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:05.920
Noah Heal.

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:12.750
Huh? No, not on me!

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.080
You need treatment soon, or else you'll–

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:16.880
It's for the best...

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:22.710
I'm too far gone. I'll only slow us down...

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:26.000
That spell was the last of my magic.

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:31.000
It makes more sense to heal you instead...

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:35.790
That doesn't make any sense at all!

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.460
How can you say that at a time like this?!

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:39.380
Mr. Cranel...

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:45.330
Go on without me. Leave me-

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:01.580
Is that a... Skull Sheep?!

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:11.960
That can't be right!

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:14.960
What do you mean the Hestia Familia's
stranded in the Dungeon?!

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.540
Bastards! You turned tail and left 'em there, didn't you?!

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:20.830
What choice did we have...?!

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:22.580
We ain't got the right weapons!

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:25.790
We nearly died tryin' to get back here!

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:31.960
Forget it. We can't leave the Hestia Familia down there.

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:33.710
I'm heading into the Dungeon.

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:34.580
Wha–?!

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:37.670
The hell you are! With injuries like those, it's suicide!

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:39.420
I'LL go. You stay here and–

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:40.210
Yo!

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:44.750
You were saying somethin' about the Hestia Famila?

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:47.210
Gimme all the details.

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:49.170
W-wait a minute...

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:52.790
You're Tsubaki Collbrande!

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:58.040
What's the captain of the
Hephaistos Familia doing here?!

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:01.170
Eh, it's a long story.

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:02.830
C'mon, let's hear it.

00:06:07.460 --> 00:06:08.880
A Floor Boss?

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:11.540
The 25th Floor exploded?

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:16.040
And to make matters worse,
the monsters are acting weird?

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:20.920
It's ridiculous, I know.
We can't wrap our heads around it either!

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:22.540
What's going on?

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:26.080
Sounds like a real dumpster fire down there, meow.

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:27.960
It doesn't meowtter!

00:06:27.960 --> 00:06:33.920
We're supposed to be the reinforcements, so let's focus
on saving Ryu and Mr. White Hair and the others!

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:35.290
Go, go!

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:37.920
Wait! Come back here, you dumb cat!

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:40.920
Interesting friends ya got there...

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:43.170
Sorry 'bout them!

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:45.830
Well, on that note...

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:49.580
Guess we oughtta go take a quick peek at the 25th Floor.

00:06:55.420 --> 00:06:56.250
Not good...

00:06:57.170 --> 00:06:58.130
Do we run...?

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:00.750
I doubt we'll get very far...

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:03.920
I guess fighting's our only option...

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:06.920
Should I let it get closer?

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:08.750
No, I have to move–

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:20.460
It disappeared?!

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:21.710
No...

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:26.080
Its skin... It's camoflauged...

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:32.920
Where? Where did it go?!

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:37.250
Calm down... Breathe...

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:39.330
TO THE RIGHT!

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:01.290
M-Mr. Cranel...!

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:26.710
Just one battle...

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:30.380
That's all it took... to do this much damage...

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:35.250
These are the Deep Floors...

00:08:37.380 --> 00:08:39.830
How in the world are we going to survive...?

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:55.630
Miss Ryu...

00:08:57.460 --> 00:09:00.330
Leave me behind and go.

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:06.830
I'm dead weight... At this point, I'll only get in the way.

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:08.920
Don't say that...

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:11.750
Go on without me.

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:16.710
No!

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:19.670
No! No! Absolutely not!

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:21.500
I am NOT going to abandon you!

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:24.290
Mr. Cranel...

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:29.750
Besides, I can't traverse the Deep Floors alone!
I'd be dead in a matter of minutes!

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:34.290
I barely made it through that
last fight even with your help!

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:35.960
You're not "dead weight"!

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:38.960
You've been to the Deep Floors before,
Miss Ryu! I NEED you!

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:53.710
Perhaps I was too hasty... It seems I lost my composure.

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:55.130
Miss Ryu...

00:09:56.920 --> 00:09:58.500
Let's head for a room.

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:02.130
One with a dead end. A small one, preferably...

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:03.790
A room?

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.750
We'll hole up there for a little while.

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:09.000
Take some time to catch our breath.

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:09.960
Okay.

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.880
Like you said, Mr. Cranel...

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:16.290
It would appear that I can still be of some use.

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:36.880
Hiyo!

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:50.210
The new footholds are up! Regroup at the front line
once you've killed the other monsters!

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:03.830
Let's move!

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:08.710
Lady Cassandra and Lady Haruhime, I want you
to cast your spells as soon as they're ready!

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:09.380
Roger!

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:15.330
TAKE THIS!

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:24.580
It dove underwater!

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:25.500
Mikoto!

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:29.540
Lady Daphne, get out of there!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.830
ZEKKA!

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:50.040
The party's working together like a well-oiled machine,
givin' Amphisbaena a run for its money...

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:56.420
We've finished off most of its pesky friends, too.

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:59.460
The ugly bastard's running out of steam...

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:12.420
Hey, do y'think we might actually... pull this off?

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:14.670
Yeah. Seems like luck's on our side.

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:21.000
You can't hide...

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:22.170
Mikoto!

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:23.130
On it!

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:25.790
When it comes up, hit it with everything you've got!

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:26.830
Right!

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:39.420
The waterfall...?!

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:40.460
What?!

00:12:41.750 --> 00:12:42.710
Up there...?!

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:45.330
Where's it trying to go...?

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:46.960
Wait a minute–!

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:42.290
We have to hurry...

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:46.290
If another monster attacks us, we're doomed...

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:55.250
Calm down, Mr. Cranel.

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:58.630
I'll keep an eye out for any monsters nearby.

00:13:59.210 --> 00:14:02.500
All you need to do is concentrate
on getting us somewhere safe.

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:05.040
Okay...

00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:10.170
When we come to a fork in the road,
choose the narrower of the two paths.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:14.630
That should eventually lead us to a room.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:15.920
Got it...

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:27.630
But still... even if we make it to a room...

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:29.630
...what comes after that?

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:36.290
Assuming we do get to rest, what's our next move?

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:38.670
How are we going to escape the Deep Floors?

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:40.750
Will we get to go home...?

00:14:41.710 --> 00:14:43.670
No, stay focused!

00:14:44.460 --> 00:14:47.290
One step at a time. Just do as Miss Ryu says.

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:57.580
A monster?!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:00.000
No, I don't sense danger...

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:06.210
That light, could it be a...?

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:13.250
It is! It's a magic stone lamp!

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:15.540
Then that must mean there's...

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:18.130
A person! There's an adventurer down here!

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:23.920
Our luck's turning around! We're not alone anymore!

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:25.420
We're saved!

00:15:27.170 --> 00:15:29.500
Please help us! We're desperate!

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:30.670
Can you spare–

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.710
N-no...

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:52.580
I knew it... We're going to die here...

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:14.460
Stay away...

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:17.000
STAY AWAY!

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:18.750
FIRE BOLT!

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:40.420
Mr. Cranel, it's alright.

00:16:41.130 --> 00:16:42.920
All three of them fled.

00:16:45.670 --> 00:16:46.630
Mr. Cranel!

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:51.540
This is where we...

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:54.670
Get ahold of yourself, Mr. Cranel!

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:01.130
I can't... anymore...

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:02.540
Mind Down?!

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:11.210
Look at me, Mr. Cranel!

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:17.420
I'm... really sorry...

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:31.210
Miss Ryu...?

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:35.040
I know it's difficult, but listen to me.

00:17:35.750 --> 00:17:39.290
Mr. Cranel, there's no reason to weep.

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:43.130
Yes, we've stumbled across
the remains of fellow adventurers.

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:46.750
But that doesn't change anything about our situation.

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:50.210
It... doesn't?

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:51.500
No, it doesn't.

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:55.250
Rather, we've reached our destination: a room to rest in.

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:57.380
That's progress.

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:00.500
So please, don't let this discourage you.

00:18:04.670 --> 00:18:05.580
Five minutes.

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:07.080
Huh?

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:09.630
I'll stand guard.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:18.330
Use that time to take a short nap. Give your body
a chance to recuperate as much as humanly possible.

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:20.580
In five minutes?

00:18:21.170 --> 00:18:26.380
In the Deep Floors, and especially in our
current predicament, it's all we can afford.

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:36.210
Sleeping anytime, anywhere in an effort to get back
on one's feet. It's the mark of a true adventurer.

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:39.170
A true adventurer...

00:18:39.630 --> 00:18:44.330
Lucky for us, your last Fire Bolt
damaged the walls and ceiling.

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:49.540
Which means... the room won't spawn monsters
for the next five minutes or so.

00:18:51.710 --> 00:18:54.460
And whether your body and mind are able to recover...

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:58.960
That's what will determine your–
no, our likelihood of survival.

00:19:01.460 --> 00:19:05.630
You rest first. After that, it'll be my turn.

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:07.460
Okay...

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:13.750
Sleep well, Mr. Cranel.

00:19:32.420 --> 00:19:33.880
Five minutes...

00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:42.170
Are you alright?

00:19:43.580 --> 00:19:44.420
I-I'm fine...

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:48.000
And the others...?

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:54.830
Damn it!

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:59.130
That was a disaster!

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:01.500
Is everyone accounted for?!

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:09.170
Where's Mikoto?!

00:20:09.710 --> 00:20:10.830
Does anyone see her?!

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:12.000
No...

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:19.750
MIKOTO!

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:30.210
The son of a bitch won't quit...!

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:34.540
GET OUTTA THE WAY!

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:52.040
But I thought...

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:58.380
We held out for this long...
only to be consumed by despair?

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:05.250
Lady Cassandra! Look out!

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:13.790
Miss Haruhime–!

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:25.500
LADY HARUHIME!

00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:32.880
Haruhime...

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:39.710
Is this really... how it ends?

00:21:45.960 --> 00:21:50.000
MIKOTO! HARUHIME!

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:58.170
Even if it's the last thing I do... YOU'RE GONNA PAY!

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:02.330
I'm gonna rip the head OFF YOUR FUCKING NECK!

00:23:37.040 --> 00:23:42.040
Next Time

00:23:37.040 --> 00:23:42.040
Daphne Lauros

00:23:37.040 --> 00:23:42.040
Friend

00:23:38.040 --> 00:23:40.540
Next time: "Daphne Lauros."
